.TH HINDAWI 1 "October 2026" "Hindawi 2026.10" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hindawi \- write, read and compile programs in your own language and script
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hindawi
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR]
.br
.B hindawicc
[\fIgcc options\fR] \fIfiles\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Hindawi lets a program be written in a human language and its own script, and compiled by the ordinary toolchain.
It has two paths. Ingestion (BURP) puts any project into any number of languages and brings it back byte for byte.
Compilation takes source written in a language through the script filter and Romenagri, and the language's
transducer turns it into the host language, which gcc compiles; names survive into the binary through Romenagri.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor
Check prerequisites and the built toolchain.
.TP
.B setup
Build Chintamani's toolchain (Romenagri and the shailis) from the pinned source.
.TP
.B languages
List the languages with their script and whether they compile.
.TP
.BI "coverage --langs " L
How complete a language is: host keywords per paradigm, and the names of the GATE programs.
.TP
.BI "ingest " SRC " --langs " L
Put a file or a project into languages. \fBreverse\fR brings it back; \fBcheck\fR does both and compares.
.TP
.BI "cc --lang " L
gcc for sources written in a language; every gcc option passes through. The same as \fBhindawicc\fR with HINDAWI_LANG set.
.TP
.BI "build " TREE " --lang " L
Build a project with its own Makefile through hindawicc.
.TP
.BI "gate [--langs " L "] [--gallery]"
Compile every GATE program from each language, run it, and compare with the English original.
.TP
.B cells
Regenerate the language cells from the lexicons.
.TP
.B stack, arduino, lab
The sovereign-stack test, the Arduino IDE drop-in, and the linguistics lab.
.TP
.B test
The build's own test suite and the fundamental regression.
.TP
.B verify
The manual verification, step by step, with the result each step should give.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
HINDAWI_LANG (the language of the sources), HINDAWI_DICT (a project's dictionary from ingestion),
HINDAWI_NATIVE_SOURCE=1 (sources ending in .c are native), ROMENAGRI (the Romenagri tools).
.SH FILES
docs/hindawi/MANUAL.md, VERIFY.md, docs/hindawi/GATE-PROGRAMS.md in the repository.
.SH AUTHOR
Abhishek Choudhary, AyeAI.
